ESP32-C6 Smart Irrigation Controller

Copyright (c) 2026 Mateusz Sury

This repository contains original firmware, host tests, documentation, and a
Zigbee2MQTT external converter for an ESP32-C6 irrigation controller.

Third-party components are not vendored in this repository. ESP-IDF and
Espressif-managed components are resolved by ESP-IDF and the ESP-IDF Component
Manager during development/builds and remain governed by their own licenses.
